{"ID":"20240205153702-1ys02nj","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153702-1ys02nj","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153702-1ys02nj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206085337-owzbva8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205163304-5cm351g\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206085337-owzbva8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:158,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:158\u0026#125;","title":"姜黄","type":"doc","updated":"20240830164601"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206085337-owzbva8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206085337-owzbva8","updated":"20240206085340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于四川、广东、福建、广西等地。\n【性状】\t呈不规则卵圆形、圆柱形或纺锤形，常弯曲，有的具短叉状分枝，长25cm，直径13cm。表面深黄色，粗糙，有皱缩纹理和明显环节，并有圆形分枝痕及须根痕。质坚实，不易折断，断面棕黄色至金黄色，角质样，有蜡样光泽，内皮层环纹明显，维管束呈点状散在。气香特异，味苦、辛。\n【性味】\t辛，苦，温。\n【功效】\t破血行气，通经止痛。用于胸胁剌痛，闭经，症瘕，风湿肩臂疼痛，跌扑肿痛。\n【注解】\t“蝉肚姜黄”：指姜黄药材外表皮呈鲜黄色，多皱缩有明显的环节，状如蝉肚。"}]},{"ID":"20240206085331-xid6fvj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206085331-xid6fvj","updated":"20240206085331"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206085331-6dkkaqd.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205163304-5cm351g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205163304-5cm351g","updated":"20240205163304"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 397px;","style":"width: 387px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"姜黄"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/姜黄-20240205163304-cifvdu9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 387px;\" parent-style=\"width: 397px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 555px;","style":"width: 545px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"姜黄1"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/姜黄1-20240705094058-smje8ox.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 545px;\" parent-style=\"width: 555px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240712101106-ik7tvxf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240712101106-ik7tvxf","updated":"20240712101106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 423px;","style":"width: 413px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240705092443-pirgzbv.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 413px;\" parent-style=\"width: 423px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240712101106-8rj63qz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240712101106-8rj63qz","updated":"20240712101106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"姜黄4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/姜黄4-20240705094750-4iceltw.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240712101106-6557rwg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240712101106-6557rwg","updated":"20240712101106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":